// Command & Conquer: Generals Zero Hour -- Brazilian Portuguese game text
//
// Plain UTF-8. One entry is a label line, a quoted string, and END.
// Lines starting with // are comments. Escapes: \n \t \" \\
//
// Translated from the English original (EnglishZH.big, generals.csf), using the names of the
// official Brazilian release (GLA, EUA, Centro de Comando, Tempestade SCUD, Lótus Negra, ...).
// Everyone addresses the player as "você", officers add "senhor" and "General". Multiplayer map
// names stay in English. Includes legacy labels for older game data.
// Checked with scripts/language/translate_kit.py. See languages/README.md before editing.

